# Input misc drivers configuration
#

config TOUCHSCREEN_ILITEK_V3
        tristate "ILITEK V3 touchscreen driver (tchip,ilitek)"
        depends on I2C || SPI_MASTER
        help
          Say Y here if you have an ILITEK TDDI touchscreen connected
          to your system via I2C or SPI bus.

          The driver supports ILITEK touch ICs with DTS compatible
          string "tchip,ilitek". It provides support for multi-touch,
          gesture recognition, and firmware update.

          If unsure, say N.

